  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience for this meme is individuals who are familiar with or perpetuate misogynistic and ableist stereotypes, particularly those who may find humor in mocking women with dyslexia by implying their consent is invalid or more easily overridden. The meme is designed to resonate with audiences who either endorse or are indifferent to harmful tropes linking disability with sexual availability and gendered consent norms. It appeals to a community that may enjoy dark humor rooted in ableism and misogyny, often found in online spaces where such content is circulated and normalized.",
